---

Greyson: Oh hello there.  
Greyson: You're a goblin? That's rare... not many of those left around these parts anymore.

->What do you mean?
    Greyson: What do I mean? The first war wiped out most of the goblins, that's what I mean.

Greyson: You don't look so good... where were you the past few years?

->Oh yeah, I was on a treasure hunt. What happened while I was gone?
    Greyson: Treasure hunting? And all you came back with is that rusty sword? Some treasure hunter you are.  
    Greyson: While you were off chasing gold, the world changed. A new Empire rose up.  
    Greyson: An Evil King is burning down everything that isn't his. Whole cities—gone.

Greyson: Anyway... do you even remember how to move? You know W, A, S, D to walk around?

Greyson: What about attacking? Try Right Mouse Click. Yeah, that's it.

Greyson: Anyway be careful there are monsters on the way to town and some town folk. If you kill the locals you can get gold to trade with the Shady Merchant in town but the town folk won't be happy with you.  

-> Gold you say?
-> How do YOU know they give you gold?
Greyson: Just don’t die before you make it to town. The monsters have invaded the forest.

===
